    "summary": "Skirt or blanket; woven on backstrap loom; made up of four panels of wool stitched together. Inner two pieces, which overlap, are black with woven warp stripes in pink green; outer pieces are blue with warp stripes in pinks and yellow. Trimmed along entirety of one shorter edge with bright yellow-based factory-made cloth with floral design in squares. Similar fabric along opposing short edge; also yellow gingham and cotton tartan trim. Hand-stitched with yellow, purple and pink acrylic yarn.",
